# Output folder

Every file this plugin creates goes in `project-context/` at the project root.

If `.cursor/adrenaline.json` exists and `outputDirs["plugin-project-context"]` holds a path, use that path. The path is relative to the project root, with no `..` and not absolute. If it is not valid, use `project-context/` and say so.

Create the folder if it does not exist. Do not write anywhere else. Do not write `.cursor/rules`, agents, commands, or skills.

Write the artifact in the language of the request. If the request names a language, use that one. Otherwise use the language the request is written in. Keep names the person already used. The type in the file name stays the English piece id. `STATUS.md` columns stay `N`, `archivo`, `estado`, `sustituye`, `notas`.
